 "name_en": "Return to Supplier (BMK)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Return to Supplier (BMK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The return process begins with the creation of a return purchase order and is followed by the outbound delivery. Subsequently the items are picked and shipped to the supplier. Alternatively, you can also directly post a goods issue. The process is closed with the creation of a credit memo, which transfers the liability to the corresponding supplier.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Return purchase order management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Stock management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Return delivery management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Picking and post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Credit memo management</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Efficient and cost-effective streamlined return processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure highly automated processes for the return of materials</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual effort</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Real-time monitoring of the return progress</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analytical list page: Monitor purchase order items</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>退货至供应商 (BMK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">退货流程从创建退货采购订单开始，然后是出库交货。随后拣配项目并运送至供应商。或者，您也可以直接过账发货。该流程通过创建贷项凭证关闭，该贷项凭证会将负债转移给相应的供应商。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">退货采购订单管理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">库存管理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">退货交货管理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">拣配和过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">贷项凭证管理</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0df74268fff549fe81d1a43936272416__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">经济有效的简化退货流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保物料退货的高度自动化流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实时监控退货进度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析列表页面：监控采购订单项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
